tion applies an already-committed configuration change?\",\n   \"hypothesis\": \"The postponed request is released only on the MsgAppResp commit path (raft.go:1550-1554), so a commit performed inside switchToConfig (raft.go:2013-2028) satisfies the release condition (newApplied >= pendingConfIndex is not involved; committedEntryInCurrentTerm() becomes true) without releasing it, leaving the received request unanswered until an unrelated commit or a client retry.\",\n   \"discriminator\": \"Whether the omission has consequences beyond the unanswered caller - for example an application that ties its own deadline to the read and re-issues it, or a caller that reuses one request context for several reads - and whether the postponed form exists for any read-only option other than ReadOnlySafe.\",\n   \"disposition\": \"active\",\n   \"parent_id\": null,\n   \"source_ids\": [\n    \"readindex-stash\",\n    \"msgappresp-release\",\n    \"switchtoconfig-commit\",\n    \"release-helper\",\n    \"heartbeatresp-readonly\",\n    \"readonly-maybeadvance\",\n    \"node-advance-contract\",\n    \"test-release-after-term-commit\"\n   ],\n   \"resume_conditions\": [],\n   \"knowledge\": [],\n   \"open_gaps\": [],\n   \"latest_execution\": {\n    \"id\": \"c86ee7b6e6604a269dc8aff31adce625\",\n    \"experiment_id\": \"ce111f77e8d4430ab1fca3ff482b3cd1-experiment\",\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"exit_code\": 0,\n    \"record\": \"logs/c86ee7b6e6604a269dc8aff31adce625/check.json\",\n    \"observations\": \"logs/c86ee7b6e6604a269dc8aff31adce625/observations.json\"\n   },\n   \"latest_interpretation\": {\n    \"id\": \"63c5875253ff45f0b609b3c0ee4c71d7-interpretation-0\",\n    \"investigation_id\": \"8769550822c045a18219e24795b9bdc0-question-0\",\n    \"experiment_id\": \"ce111f77e8d4430ab1fca3ff482b3cd1-experiment\",\n    \"source_ids\": [\n     \"readindex-stash\",\n     \"msgappresp-release\",\n     \"switchtoconfig-commit\",\n     \"release-helper\",\n     \"heartbeatresp-reado